{
  "id": "b2-e45-exams-and-pressure",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Exams and pressure",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you feel before an important exam?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what do you do to prepare for tests?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you work better under pressure?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what was the best moment of your school years?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e45-a1",
            "b2-e45-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show students at school. Compare the photographs, and say how the students might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8500
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you cope with pressure at school or work?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e45-b1",
            "b2-e45-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people thinking about studying. Compare the photographs, and say why the people might be worried or happy.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think parents put too much pressure on children?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways to reduce exam stress, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9900
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e45-exams-and-pressure",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these ideas help students feel less stressed?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e45-exams-and-pressure",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most helpful for students?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about exam stress and school pressure.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that exams are not a fair way to test students. What do you think?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think schools should have more continuous assessment instead of final exams?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, what can parents do to help their children before an exam?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it more important to get good marks or to learn useful skills?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how would you design the perfect way of testing students?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e45-exams-and-pressure/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
